{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Amazon 為 Apple iPad Air (M4) 帶來網購優惠，11 吋 Wi-Fi 128GB 型號減價 13%，入手價為 US$649。同時 13 吋 Wi-Fi 128GB 型號亦以 US$849 發售，較原價減 11%。兩款尺寸均配備 M4 晶片及 Liquid Retina 螢幕，應付日常文書、剪片與 AI 任務更從容。若有需要換機或添置平板，現時價位值得把握。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"11 吋 iPad Air (M4) 藍色\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"500\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/41Mceeej-Qw-L.jpg\" width=\"500\"/></figure>\n<h2>iPad Air (M4) 重點功能</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>M4 晶片效能升級</strong>：Apple M4 晶片帶來更強圖像處理與多工表現，處理複雜 AI 任務、剪片及多個應用程式切換時更流暢，適合需要流動工作效率的用家。</li>\n<li><strong>清晰抗反光螢幕</strong>：Liquid Retina 螢幕支援 P3 寬色域、True Tone 與超低反光，戶外或室內觀看都更清晰；配合 Apple Intelligence，可在 iPadOS 視窗系統同時開啟多個 App 處理工作。</li>\n<li><strong>配件與拍攝兼容</strong>：前後 12MP 鏡頭支援 4K 拍片與文件掃描，並兼容 Apple Pencil Pro、Apple Pencil (USB-C) 及 Magic Keyboard，繪圖、筆記與打字可在同一裝置完成。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GQVBJT4J?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"Apple iPad Air 11-inch (M4): Liquid Retina Display, 128GB, 12MP Front/Back Camera, Wi-Fi 7 with Apple N1, Touch ID, All-Day Battery Life — Blue\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41MceeejQwL._SL500_.jpg\"/>\n</a>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GQVBJT4J?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Apple iPad Air 11-inch (M4): Liquid Retina Display, 128GB, 12MP Front/Back Camera, Wi-Fi 7 with Apple N1, Touch ID, All-Day Battery Life — Blue</a>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>$649.00</p>\n<p>$749.00</p>\n<p>-13%</p>\n</p>\n<p>In Stock</p>\n</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GQVBJT4J?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">立即購買</a>\n</p>\n</p>\n</p>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GQVLJGJH?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"Apple iPad Air 13-inch (M4): Liquid Retina Display, 128GB, 12MP Front/Back Camera, Wi-Fi 7 with Apple N1, Touch ID, All-Day Battery Life — Space Gray\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/419ufaFWSEL._SL500_.jpg\"/>\n</a>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GQVLJGJH?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Apple iPad Air 13-inch (M4): Liquid Retina Display, 128GB, 12MP Front/Back Camera, Wi-Fi 7 with Apple N1, Touch ID, All-Day Battery Life — Space Gray</a>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>$849.00</p>\n<p>$949.00</p>\n<p>-11%</p>\n</p>\n<p>In Stock</p>\n</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GQVLJGJH?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">立即購買</a>\n</p>\n</p>\n</p>\n<h2>為什麼會顯示沒有貨？</h2>\n<p>如果大家的 Amazon 帳號設定了本地地址，這樣當顯示美國限定產品時是會顯示「沒有供應」，然而大家只要輸入一些<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/2019/05/06/buy-and-ship/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">集運公司的地址</a>，這樣就可以正常顯示價格及送貨。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"Amazon 美國送貨地址設定\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"868\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/amazon-us-address.jpg\" width=\"1630\"/></figure>\n<h2>購買美版的 AppleCare 保修問題</h2>\n<p>不少人也對海外購買 Apple 產品的保修有疑問，其實 Apple 產品很多時也是全球性維修，不過 AppleCare+ 的意外換機則必須要原來的購買地才可。那就是你不能買美國版 AppleCare+ 在香港／台灣要求意外更換，必須要在美國更換。不過，維修一般沒有問題，當然每個地區的 Apple Store 也有其不同的。</p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T22:04:21.891875+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1155,"images":4,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T21:38:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T10:46:04.371011+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T21:57:53.967426+00:00","content_hash":"a3d79644e5b8de24c8437fdfb8a846bd8598a71e01dafaf1fd24d87c9d942d06","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}